If you're reading this I've been missing in my hometown for 3 days
I'm not alive anymore.

On September 26th 2026 I took my own life.

I'm sorry for not telling you anything.

Thank you for being with me. You're the best thing that has ever happened to me. 

The friend* I made has had kept me going as long as I have.

I wouldn't be writing this if you weren't here for me. I don't wanna call you by name, but i think you know.

I wanted to keep going until I finished all my projects, but I wont ever be finished with them haha.

My work is one of the few things I found joy in, and I'm glad I was able to share it with some people.

Sorry if you expected something more personal. I didn't write any individual letters, it's a lot of writing.

I know a lot of people won't trust this note. I've done this stuff in the past and I know some people won't take it as that.

If you change your mind one day, it's okay. I'll be waiting.

Good night.
